  m_text: "A\xB3R (Affect-Adaptive Augmented Reality) is an intelligent spatial assistant
    designed for electronics circuit assembly.\n\n\u2022 Real-Time Spatial Guidance:
    3D holographic chevrons and precision ring markers pinpoint component coordinates.\n\n\u2022
    On-Device Affect Perception: Evaluates learner confusion, frustration, and engagement
    at 2 Hz via native GPU acceleration.\n\n\u2022 Closed-Loop Interventions: Dynamically
    modulates visual assistance cues when cognitive tension is detected.\n\n\u2022
    Hardware Co-Verification: Connects to breadboard sensors to physically verify
    circuit completion."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
